            <ArticleTitle>Use of recombinant human cardiac Troponin T for standardization of third generation Troponin T methods.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>128-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Elecsys Troponin T third generation assay uses recombinant human cardiac troponin T as standard material. The new assay has a linear calibration curve. Thus, linearity problems observed with the second generation assay have been eliminated. The assay has high precision, especially at the low end of measuring range (inter-assay CV &lt; 10% at 0.1 microgram/L). The new standardization does not change the cut-off value of 0.1 microgram/L. The use of recombinant human cardiac troponin T as standard material enables a reproducible and reliable standardization of troponin T assays.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
